        "topic": "Sentence structure & word order",
        "question_type": "Practical",
        "exam_year": "2022",
        "question_text": "<p>Rewrite the following Ewe sentence in the <b>negative form</b>:<br><i>\u00abEsi le x\u0254 me.\u00bb</i> (Esi is in the house.)</p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>In Ewe, the negative form is created by adding <i>\u00abm\u00e9-\u00bb</i> before the verb and <i>\u00abo\u00bb</i> at the end of the sentence. The correct negative form is:<br><i>\u00abEsi m\u00e9le x\u0254 me o.\u00bb</i> (Esi is not in the house.)</p>",
        "reference_passage": null,
        "novel": null,
        "comments_count": 0,
        "options": [],
        "_page_num": 1,
