        "question_type": "Objective",
        "exam_year": "2022",
        "question_text": "<p>What is the meaning of the Akan proverb: <i>\u00ab\u0186k\u0254m de \u025b, na \u025bky\u025b obiara.\u00bb</i>?</p>",
